:shell wc \-l %p
:shell diff <(echo %b) %p
.EE
.SH Capture tokens
A trailing token (preceded by whitespace) redirects stdout back into the
editor instead of running the command interactively.
The whole splice is one undo group.
.PP
.TS
tab(@);
lw(35.0n) lw(35.0n).
